meta {
  name: Complete Production
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

post {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/restaurants/{{restaurant_id}}/production/orders/{{production_order_id}}/complete
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

body:json {
  {
      "produced_qty": 9,
      "wasted_qty": 1,
      "waste_reason": "cooking_error"
  }
}

docs {
  produced_qty is optional (defaults to the requested quantity; 0 is allowed when everything was lost). Consumes the recipe ingredients and adds to the dish's prepared stock.

  wasted_qty (optional) is what was lost while cooking: its ingredients are consumed too, it is binned from the dish's stock and logged in the waste register.
  waste_reason: cooking_error (default) | damaged | other
  422 on produced_qty when produced + wasted is 0.
}
